  "body": "Asked by @domenic, for a 100x100 ImageBitmap, if we pass { resizeWidth: 50 }, we get a 50x100 result by following the current specs, stretched. Is that correct?\n\nThis change makes it scale proportionally if only one of the resizeWidth and resizeHeight is provided.\n\nPlease review. @domenic @annevk @junov \n",
